# Scalability & Adapter Patterns

## Layer flow
`Controller → Service → RepositoryPort → PrismaAdapter`

## New module checklist
- [ ] `ports/{entity}.repository.port.ts` + DI token symbol
- [ ] `adapters/prisma-{entity}.repository.ts` — Prisma types stay here only
- [ ] Service constructor `@Inject(TOKEN) private repo: Port`
- [ ] Unit tests mock port; integration tests use real adapter

## External integrations
Wrap in port under `infrastructure/`: `StoragePort`, `QueuePort`, `CachePort`, `PushNotificationPort`, `EmailPort`

## Cross-module
- Call other module's **exported Service** OR publish domain event to queue
- Never query another module's tables from your repository

## Config
- `APP_ENV`: dev | uat | prod — validate with Zod at startup
- Access via ConfigService only — never scatter `process.env` in services

## Logging
Pino JSON: `{ requestId, compCode, empId, module, action, durationMs, env }`

## Extract-ready modules
Keep `reports/`, `sync/`, `notifications/` self-contained for future `apps/report-service` split.
